{
    "title": "EarnIn: Make Every Day Payday",
    "description": "Instantly access your pay in advance \u2014 without waiting for a paycheck. EarnIn lets you access your pay as you work \u2014 not days or weeks later. All with no loans, no borrowing money, no interest, no mandatory fees, and no credit checks.\r\n\r\nWith Cash Out on EarnIn, get up to $100/day and up to $750/paycheck to cover day-to-day costs, unexpected expenses, and everything in between[5]. Plus, we\u2019ll help you keep your credit goals moving forward with free credit monitoring directly in the app.\r\n\r\nCash advances and payday loans can be misleading and costly. EarnIn simplifies things with easy, no-cost options that tap the money you\u2019ve already earned to get you paid in advance[1]. All with no interest, no credit checks, and no surprises[5].\r\n\r\nEarnIn also provides Balance Shield that notify you whenever your bank balance runs low[4]. Skip the cash advances and payday loans. Stay on budget with your money in advance from EarnIn.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s how Cash Out on EarnIn works:\r\nDownload the EarnIn app and add your info\r\nAccess up to $100/day of your pay & up to $750/pay period\r\nTip what feels right (optional)\r\nAny money accessed, plus optional fees and tips, is automatically repaid when your next paycheck comes\r\n\r\nDownload EarnIn for easy, instant access to your money when you want it.\r\n\r\nYOUR MONEY AT YOUR SPEED\r\n- Connect your bank account to instantly access your pay in advance\r\n- EarnIn works with Bank of America, Wells Fargo, Chase, Capital One, and more\r\n- Get paid in minutes with Lightning Speed transfers[1]\r\n- Smarter & faster alternative to cash advances\r\n\r\nGET UP TO $750 EVERY PAY PERIOD\r\n- Get up to $100/day and up to $750/pay period as you work to handle financial emergencies, cover loan payments, or keep up with day-to-day expenses\r\n- Better than a cash advance or payday loan \u2013 get money from your own pay instantly[3]\r\n\r\nFREE CREDIT SCORE TRACKING\r\n- Monitor your credit score[6] for a full picture of your financial health\r\n- Get alerts when your credit file changes & keep track of suspicious or fraudulent activity\r\n- Unlike loan apps, EarnIn provides financial tools to help you monitor your credit score & move toward your goals\r\n\r\nBACKED BY 24/7 SUPPORT\r\nQuestions or issues? Our Live Chat team is available 24/7, 365 days a year.\r\n\r\n---\r\nEarnIn is not affiliated with Chime, Dave, Albert, Brigit, CashNetUSA, Empower, Klover, MoneyLion, Cleo, Cash App, Daily Pay, Google Pay or Credit Karma.\r\nEarnIn is not a payday loan or a personal loan. There's no interest or APR to transfer from your paycheck.\r\nEarnIn does not sell your personal data to third parties. Learn more about our privacy policy: earnin.com/privacy\r\nEarnIn\r\n200 Portage Ave\r\nPalo Alto, CA 94306\r\n---\r\nDisclaimers:\r\nEarnIn services may not be available in all states.\r\n[1] Fees apply to use Lightning Speed. Lightning Speed may not be available to all Community Members. Transfers may take up to thirty minutes, actual transfer speeds will depend on your bank, see Cash Out User Agreement for details.\r\n[2] Tipping options will vary between tools.\r\n[3] Tip Yourself Account funds are held with Evolve Bank & Trust, member FDIC and FDIC insured up to $250,000. Tip Yourself is a 0% Annual Percentage Yield and $0 monthly fee service. Your Tip Yourself Account and any Tip Jars are not Savings Accounts. For more information/details visit https://www.earnin.com/evolve-bank-and-trust\r\n[4] Balance Shield Cash Outs are subject to your available earnings, Daily Max and Pay Period Max.\r\n[5] Subject to your available earnings, Daily Max and Pay Period Max. EarnIn does not charge interest on Cash Outs. Restrictions and/or third party fees may apply. For more info and for our privacy policy, visit earnin.com/tos\r\n[6] Calculated on the VantageScore 3.0 model. Your VantageScore 3.0 from Experian\u00ae indicates your credit risk level and is not used by all lenders, so don\u2019t be surprised if your lender uses a score that\u2019s different from your VantageScore 3.0. Learn more: https://www.experian.com/assets/consumer-information/product-sheets/vantagescore-3.pdf",
